  "description": "In-situ probes and contact instruments for direct measurement of surface and atmospheric composition: mass spectrometers (SAM on Curiosity), X-ray fluorescence and diffraction (CheMin), gas chromatographs, tunable laser spectrometers, and surface sampling mechanisms (drills, scoops, pyrotechnic penetrators). Heritage from Viking, Phoenix, and Mars 2020.",
